(10, 'Universal Harvester Inc.', 'uploads/universal harvester.jpg', 'uploads/img_68e662955c0a75.38167316.jpg,uploads/img_68f87f3bad6830.17398091.png', 'Universal Harvester is one of the leading fertilizer company in the Philippines, dedicated to providing high-quality yet affordable agricultural solutions. Since its establishment in 2003, the company has demonstrated a strong commitment to innovation and excellence. Leveraging state-of-the-art technologies, Universal Harvester excels in the direct manufacturing, local distribution, importation, and exportation of premium fertilizers. Our lineup includes essential agricultural products such as Muriate of Potash (MOP), Sulphate of Potash (SOP), Hydrochloric Acid (HCI),  Sodium Hypochlorite (NaOCI), and many more.', 'PH4Q+CHV, Coastal Road, Lapuz, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.367595546534!2d122.58635597504089!3d10.706104089438453!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5a22dcce96b%3A0x57e3da210ab7e36a!2sUniversal%20Harvester%2C%20Inc.!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759901006795!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Y26bJA8oi1eaF6JL9', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//PH4Q%2BCHV+Universal+Harvester,+Inc.,+Coastal+Road,+Lapuz,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7061041,122.5889309,17z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee5a22dcce96b:0x57e3da210ab7e36a!2m2!1d122.5889309!2d10.7061041?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'https://www.universalharvester.com/', 'Monday to Saturday:  8 AM–5 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '', '[]', '[{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 16: BITO-ON TO JARO VIA BALABAGO\",\"link\":\"bus16.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 18: TAGBAK TO CITY PROPER VIA COASTAL\",\"link\":\"bus18.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 19: BITO-ON TO CITY PROPER VIA LA PAZ\",\"link\":\"bus19.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 16: BITO-ON TO JARO VIA BALABAGO\",\"link\":\"j