(14, 'A-Bikes Enterprises', 'uploads/A-Bikes Enterprises.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ef3d6d2153f3.45516227.jpg,uploads/img_68f8e337a1c561.86332672.png', 'Whether you\'re a casual rider or a seasoned cyclist, A-Bikes Enterprises offers quality products to meet your cycling needs. The shop is known for its friendly service and knowledgeable staff, ensuring that customers receive expert advice and assistance in selecting the right products for their cycling endeavors.', 'The Executive Bldg., Ledesma St, Hipodromo, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d62716.397189997784!2d122.51357084863284!3d10.75182999999999!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56706e5f80b%3A0x11767d71190cb0b8!2sA-Bikes%20Enterprises!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759039106186!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/xf8iSAKtCahDdm5RA', '', '', 'Open Monday - Sunday: 8:00 AM - 5:15 PM', '(033) 337 3163', '[]', '', 'bicycle_shop14.php', '', '', '', '2025-09-29 12:22:52', '[]'),
(15, 'VINSAM BIKE SHOP REPAIR & SERVICES', 'uploads/VINSAM BIKE SHOP REPAIR & SERVICES.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ef3d771a2af9.78761805.jpg,uploads/img_68f8e33e95f060.34363193.png', 'The shop focuses on maintenance and repair work—tunes, parts replacement, adjustments, and perhaps custom work. They likely carry accessories and spare parts suited for common bike models in the area. The service orientation suggests they support both casual riders and regular bike commuters who need reliable upkeep.', 'Zone 2b, La Paz, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d62726.24398191893!2d122.48710564863279!3d10.704352799999999!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee506c31d762b%3A0x6f1af721b7aa57a9!2sVINSAM%20BIKE%20SHOP%20REPAIR%20%26%20SERVICES!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759039149206!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/k3kuWEHNddQoZRsp6', '', '', 'Open Monday - Sunday: 7:00 AM - 8:00 PM', '0930 700 3736 ', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Vinsam-Bikeshop-100076296790557/', 'bicycle_shop15.php', '', '', 'spguevarra85@gmail.com', '2025-09-29 12:23:30', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"jeep5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 15: MOLO TO CITY PROPER VIA BULAURTE\",\"link\":\"jeep15.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"bus5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 15: MOLO TO CITY PROPER VIA BULAURTE\",\"link\":\"bus15.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]'),
(16, 'Tretton', 'uploads/Tretton.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ef3d81d65de2.37237694.jpg,uploads/img_68f8e3465dde20.72803673.png', 'They provide bicycle sales, parts, and likely repair services for local riders.', 'Phase 4 Alta Tierra Village, Jaro, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d62726.24398191893!2d122.48710564863279!3d10.704352799999999!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5a95f951307%3A0xf2950b6012253a84!2sTretton!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759039172061!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZHPmsD2njwCPk3mR6', '', '', 'Open Monday - Sunday:  9:00 AM - 7:00 PM', '0927 905 0452 ', '[]', '', 'bicycle_shop16.php', '', '', 'tretton.ph@gmail.com', '2025-09-29 12:24:04', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep10.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus10.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]'),
(17, 'J Unibike Parts Center', 'uploads/J Unibike Parts Center.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ef3d94ea3b72.02159920.jpg,uploads/img_68f8e34e9ec835.28043006.png', 'J Unibike Parts Center is a well-known bicycle parts and accessory shop in downtown Iloilo City, located on Valeria Street. It operates daily from 9:00 AM to 8:00 PM and is a go-to destination for cyclists seeking parts, spares, and related gear in the city center. With a long business day and a central location near SM Delgado and the Unitop area, the shop is accessible and well-positioned for both casual riders and repair professionals needing components on demand.', '113 Valeria St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d62726.24398191893!2d122.48710564863279!3d10.704352799999999!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56f7cd3ec87%3A0x9be7e22c7a3adbfb!2sJ%20Unibike%20Parts%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759039196756!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/aeF4B3PnuTjkABBB8', '', '', 'Open Monday - Sunday: 9:00 AM - 8:00 PM', '(033) 337 5723', '[]', '', 'bicycle_shop17.php', '', '', '', '2025-09-29 12:24:32', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep10.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus10.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]'),
(18, 'Reen Cyce Hub', 'uploads/Reen Cyce Hub.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ef3da0097d39.60365085.jpg,uploads/img_68f8e358a227d5.37086741.png', 'Reen Cycle Hub is a full-service bike shop. They’re located conveniently in the St. Joseph Building in Sambag. The shop carries a range of bicycles, parts, and accessories, and provides gear for both casual riders and cycling enthusiasts. With daily hours from 10 AM to 7 PM, and reachable via phone or email, they aim to serve local cyclists needing parts, repairs, or gear in a friendly and accessible setting.', 'Door 3, St Joseph Building, Jaro, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d62719.65492570483!2d122.46202104863282!3d10.736145500000019!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee500300aae11%3A0x7bb98f5ff39cbff4!2sReen%20Cyce%20Hub!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759039240930!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/EVct7meGqVGHk9AR8', '', '', 'Monday - Sunday: 10:00 AM – 7:00 PM', 'reencyclehub08@gmail.com', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/robsbikeshop/', 'bicycle_shop18.php', '', '', 'spguevarra85@gmail.com', '2025-09-29 12:25:01', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"jeep5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 12: MANDURRIAO TO CITY PROPER VIA FESTIVE WALK \\/ B. AQUINO AVE.\",\"link\":\"jeep12.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 13: HIBAO-AN TO CITY PROPER VIA TABUCAN\",\"link\":\"jeep13.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 14: HIBAO-AN TO JARO VIA B. AQUINO AVE. \\/ FESTIVE\",\"link\":\"jeep14.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"n