(11, 'VÈLO Bistro', 'uploads/velo.jpg', 'uploads/img_689043fbbcf2c2.06849520.jpg,uploads/68f885a4eb9e8_Velo Bistro.png', 'A vibrant café and bistro in Iloilo City that caters to cycling enthusiasts and food lovers alike. Located near the Esplanade, it offers a cozy ambiance with a menu featuring specialty coffee, light meals, and refreshing beverages. The bistro is known for its bike-friendly environment, providing a welcoming space for cyclists to relax and refuel. Whether you\'re looking to enjoy a cup of coffee or a hearty meal, VÈLO Bistro offers a unique experience that combines passion for cycling with a love for good food.\r\n\r\n', ' Molo Mansion, Yusay-Consing Mansion, Locsin St, Molo, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d15681.372409286065!2d122.5333060871582!3d10.707997299999995!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5004658920b%3A0xccf1897342f69cad!2sV%C3%88LO%20Bistro!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sph!4v1751899743561!5m2!1sen!2sph', 'https://www.facebook.com/people/V%C3%89LO/61566564125407/', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/HsynTheAKqQXTEFe6', 'Monday 8 AM–10 PM\r\nTuesday 8 AM–10 PM\r\nWednesday 8 AM–10 PM\r\nThursday 8 AM–10 PM\r\nFriday 8 AM–10 PM\r\nSaturday 8 AM–10 PM\r\nSunday  8 AM–10 PM\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '[]', '', '2025-07-08 13:02:44', '2026-02-26 11:20:50', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/V%C3%88LO+Bistro/@10.7079973,122.5333061,15z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1scafe+in+iloilo+city!3m6!1s0x33aee5004658920b:0xccf1897342f69cad!8m2!3d10.6959945!4d122.5430596!15sChNjYWZlIGluIGlsb2lsbyBjaXR5WhUiE2NhZmUgaW4gaWxvaWxvIGNpd', 'cafe11.php', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"jeep5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE