UTE 23: MOHON TO MANDURRIAO BUSINESS DISTRICT\",\"link\":\"bus23.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]'),
(15, '3rd Gen Glory\'s Cafe', 'uploads/3rd Gen.jpg', 'uploads/68f89c6d4d5d3_3rd Gen.jpg,uploads/68f89fcf28046_3rd Gen Glory_s Cafe.png', '3rd Gen Glory\'s Cafe is a heritage coffee shop located in Iloilo City, Philippines. Established in 1948 by Sixto \"Nonoy Pedring\" Alloso Chua Sr. and managed by Gloria Serania, the original café, then known as Glory\'s Cafeteria and Carinderia, was situated at the Iloilo Central Market. It served native coffee using traditional methods, catering to vendors, jeepney drivers, policemen, and politicians.\r\n', ' Sayson Heritage House, 1927 Avanceña, Quezon St, Villa Arevalo District, Iloilo City', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31364.884225486006!2d122.48181939125062!3d10.687308596984531!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5392a386a05%3A0x6e3c1ccd300867ac!2s3rd%20Gen%20Glory&#39;s%20Cafe!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1740577285877!5m2!1sfil!2sph', '', ' https://maps.app.goo.gl/RoWfjX8HjWXGNdag8', 'Monday - Sunday: 7:00 AM - 9:00 PM', '0917 620 5688', '', '', '', '', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/3rdGenGlorysCafe/', '2025-10-22 08:41:44', '2026-02-26 11:28:05', '', 'cafe15.php', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'cafeglorys@gmail.com', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"jeep2.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 17: VILLA BAYBAY TO CITY PROPER VIA BONIFACIO\",\"link\":\"jeep17.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 20: MOHON TO JARO VIA SO-OC\\/ FESTIVE WALK\\/ ISATU\",\"link\":\"jeep20.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"bus2.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 17: VILLA BAYBAY TO CITY PROPER VIA BONIFACIO\",\"link\":\"bus17.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 20: MOHON TO JARO VIA SO-OC\\/ FESTIVE WALK\\/ ISATU\",\"link\":\"bus20.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]'),
(16, 'Cafe et Al ', 'uploads/Cafe et Al.jpg', 'uploads/68f89cd1507ed_Cafe et Al.jpg,uploads/68f89fd842cf8_Cafe et Al .png', ' Café et Al is a cozy coffee shop located in the Molo district of Iloilo City, Philippines. Situated at 238 Compania Street, Zone 4 Maloto, near Garrison Street, it offers a peaceful ambiance ideal for starting your day with a cup of aromatic coffee. The café is open from Monday to Saturday, 7:00 AM to 8:00 PM, and is closed on Sundays.\r\n', 'Zone 3, maloto, 238 Compania Street, garrison st, Molo, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31363.271123501137!2d122.50877022743225!3d10.702911440063716!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aef17f998b6aff%3A0x815a0f8e5e515e94!2sCaf%C3%A9%20et%20Al!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1740577364608!5m2!1sfil!2sph', '', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Ps8twPSx9mtZ7zTL8', 'Monday - Saturday: 7:00 AM to 8:00 PM', ' 0929 595 6364', '', '', '', '', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Caf%C3%A9-et-Al-original-100069097341882/', '2025-10-22 08:42:48', '2026-02-26 11:32:16', '', 'cafe16.php', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'aldwinmanar83@gmail.com', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"jeep2.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 9: MOHON TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep9.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 15: MOLO TO CITY PROPER VIA BULAURTE\",\"link\":\"jeep15.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 17: VILLA BAYBAY TO CITY PROPER VIA BONIFACIO\",\"link\":\"jeep17.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"bus2.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 9: MOHON TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus9.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 15: MOLO TO CITY PROPER VIA BULAURTE\",\"link\":\"bus15.ph