(17, 'Grace Foursquare Gospel Church', 'uploads/grace.jpg', 'uploads/img_68e5e503e38b93.26749242.jpg,uploads/img_68f8e6405f3582.17148764.png', 'Grace Foursquare Gospel Church is a Pentecostal Christian church affiliated with the Church of the Foursquare Gospel in the Philippines (CFGPI). It serves the local community in Iloilo City, focusing on worship, discipleship, and community outreach.', 'Block 5, Lapuz, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d501490.7138180755!2d121.98082592891001!3d10.895492616947301!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee50ce8b6714b%3A0x96159af31ee29bf9!2sGrace%20Foursquare%20Gospel%20Church!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759037864296!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/NZNditKtcgoqfXuw9', '', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Grace+Foursquare+Gospel+Church,+Block+5,+Lapuz,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.8954926,121.9808259,10z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee50ce8b6714b:0x96159af31ee29bf9!2sGrace+Foursquare+Gospel+Church!8m2!3d10.7070237!4d122.5747296!16s%2Fg%2F11snqj2bvz!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee50ce8b6714b:0x96159af31ee29bf9!2m2!1d122.5747364!2d10.7070296?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', '0995 194 3551', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/gracefoursquaregospel/', 'church17.php', NULL, '2025-10-06 12:44:09', 'gracefoursquaregospelchurch@gmail.com', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 19: BITO-ON TO CITY PROPER VIA LA PAZ\",\"link\":\"jeep19.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 18: TAGBAK TO CITY PROPER VIA COASTAL\",\"link\":\"bus18.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 19: BITO-ON TO CITY PROPER VIA LA PAZ\",\"link\":\"bus19.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]'),
(18, 'Calaparan Foursquare Gospel Church', 'uploads/foursqure.jpg', 'uploads/img_68e5e50f135de4.29397209.jpg,uploads/img_68f8e64a52b750.79054776.png', 'Calaparan Foursquare Gospel Church is a Pentecostal Christian congregation affiliated with the Church of the Foursquare Gospel in the Philippines (CFGPI). Located in Zone 10, Calaparan, Arevalo, Iloilo City, it serves the local community with a focus on worship, discipleship, and outreach. The church holds regular services, though specific times are not publicly listed. For the most accurate and up-to-date information, it is recommended to contact the church directly or visit their official Facebook page.', 'MGJH+965, Calaparan, Villa Arevalo District, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.6933316961563!2d122.52552107504036!3d10.680894689462137!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aef10028e37627%3A0x7736e60dcf2d01e3!2sCALAPARAN%20FOURSQUARE%20GOSPEL%20CHURCH!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759037899262!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/BCZifsP6AxTpapuHA', '', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//MGJH%2B965+CALAPARAN+FOURSQUARE+GOSPEL+CHURCH,+Calaparan,+Villa+Arevalo+District,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.6808947,122.528096,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aef10028e37627:0x7736e60dcf2d01e3!2sCALAPARAN+FOURSQUARE+GOSPEL+CHURCH!8m2!3d10.6808947!4d122.528096!16s%2Fg%2F11yj95yg7l!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aef10028e37627:0x7736e60dcf2d01e3!2m2!1d122.5281059!2d10.6808033?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', '', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/groups/23862987279987619', 'church18.php', NULL, '2025-10-06 12:45:06', '', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"jeep2.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"bus2.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]'),
(19, 'Jaro Evangelical Church, Inc.', 'uploads/jaro.jpg', 'uploads/img_68e5e51a47a395.66545691.jpg,uploads/img_68f8e653efbf45.75782424.png', 'Jaro Evangelical Church (JEC), also known as the First Baptist Church in the Philippines, is a historic Protestant congregation located in Jaro, Iloilo City. Established in 1900 by Filipino-American missionaries Eric Lund and Braulio Manikan, JEC holds the distinction of being the first Baptist church in the country and the first Protestant church outside Manila. It played a pivotal role in the founding of Central Philippine University (CPU) in 1905 and is affiliated with the Convention of Philippine Baptist Churches.\r\nWhile specific service times are not publicly listed, JEC holds regular worship services, including Sunday services. For the most accurate and up-to-date information, it is recommended to contact the church directly or visit their official Facebook page.', 'Jaro Evangelical Church, Inc.', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.146350648654!2d122.55538297504121!3d10.723193289422362!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee50009c69cc5%3A0x797be7833f0e54d2!2sJARO%20EVANGELICAL%20Church!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759037946001!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/hoYxThD9DPuvCE5g8', '', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//PHF5%2B75G+JARO+EVANGELICAL+Church,+Luna+Street,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7231933,122.5579579,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee50009c69cc5:0x797be7833f0e54d2!2sJARO+EVANGELICAL+Church!8m2!3d10.7231933!4d122.5579579!16s%2Fg%2F11xdl6n1g4!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee50009c69cc5:0x797be7833f0e54d2!2m2!1d122.5579509!2d10.7231835?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', '(033) 329 3242', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/JECIloilo/', 'church19.php', NULL, '2025-10-06 12:45:58', '', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep10.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"RO