(20, 'IGLESIA NI CRISTO - Iloilo City Local', 'uploads/IGLESIA.png', 'uploads/img_68e5e5a350cc63.00244687.png,uploads/img_68f8e65e194586.25822119.png', 'Iglesia Ni Cristo (INC) is a Christian denomination founded in the Philippines in 1914 by Felix Y. Manalo. The Iloilo City Local congregation is one of the many local chapels serving members in the area. INC churches are known for their distinctive architecture with spires and large auditoriums.', 'MHR8+V39, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d125441.23515025347!2d122.3243402842429!3d10.731506449345723!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee566abd53d71%3A0x4c491a34c6c6d76b!2sIGLESIA%20NI%20CRISTO%20-%20Lokal%20ng%20Iloilo%20City%20%5BILOILO%20SOUTH%20District%20Office%5D!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759038074056!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Bp7eU9D9JmgRBRTh8', '', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//MHR8%2BV39+IGLESIA+NI+CRISTO+-+Lokal+ng+Iloilo+City+%5BILOILO+SOUTH+District+Office%5D,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7315064,122.3243403,12z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee566abd53d71:0x4c491a34c6c6d76b!2sIGLESIA+NI+CRISTO+-+Lokal+ng+Iloilo+City+%5BILOILO+SOUTH+District+Office%5D!8m2!3d10.6921655!4d122.5652398!16s%2Fg%2F1vpq4d9m!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee566abd53d71:0x4c491a34c6c6d76b!2m2!1d122.5653356!2d10.6919857?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', '', '[]', 'https://directory.iglesianicristo.net/districts/iloilo-south', 'church20.php', NULL, '2025-10-06 12:46:37', '', '[]'),
