(3, '2GO Express', 'uploads/img_68e5d8c9300e86.94170136.jpg', 'uploads/img_68e5d8c9306b59.34552108.jpg,uploads/img_68f90abe6c3751.88782024.png', '2GO EXPRESS is the first and last mile fulfillment partner, and the courier solutions provider of 2GO Group, Inc. The business capitalizes on its broad network and caters to different delivery formats to meet the requirements of our customers in a timely manner, while also enabling the surge of B2B and B2C growth. Productivity gains are created for the e-commerce, courier, and general cargo businesses by enabling quick turnaround time for sea-bound cargo as well as for northbound and southbound parcels and packages. 2GO is looking forward to many more developments in its operations as it continues to expand its portfolio of corporate clients.', ' MHXF+XWQ, Lapuz, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d15681.661444639938!2d122.55631884467421!3d10.702411081068483!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee573ca1dc497%3A0x774693edb532b94!2s2GO%20Express%2C%20Inc.%20-%20Iloilo%20Branch%20Warehouse!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759746559920!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/58nTkbej5u6Branp9', 'https://express.2go.com.ph/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//MHXF%2BXWQ+2GO+Express,+Inc.+-+Iloilo+Branch+Warehouse,+Lapuz,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7024111,122.5563188,15z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee573ca1dc497:0x774693edb532b94!2s2GO+Express,+Inc.+-+Iloilo+Branch+Warehouse!8m2!3d10.6999597!4d122.5748443!16s%2Fg%2F1hcb0gqch!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee573ca1dc497:0x774693edb532b94!2m2!1d122.5748698!2d10.6999504?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Monday: 8 AM–5 PM\r\nTuesday: 8 AM–5 PM\r\nWednesday: 8 AM–5 PM\r\nThursday: 8 AM–5 PM\r\nFriday: 8 AM–5 PM\r\nSaturday: 8 AM–5 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '0333379853', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ' Arrastre Pier, PPA Terminal Building, Bldg Fort San Pedro Dr, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'courier3.php'