(4, 'DHL Express', 'uploads/img_68e5d8ea84ab06.47284094.jpg', 'uploads/img_68e5d8ea84d806.91603895.jpg,uploads/img_68f90adbc836b7.89506516.png', 'DHL Express in Iloilo is a service point for fast, reliable international shipping and courier delivery, offering door-to-door service for documents and parcels. It provides express options for businesses and individuals, handling customs and providing real-time tracking for shipments to over 220 countries and territories. Service locations include a new partnership at Robinsons Jaro and other points in partnership with companies like W Express and M Lhuillier.  ', 'Basement 1 Kiosk B-02, Robinsons Mall, E Lopez St, Jaro, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31360.8049158226!2d122.51794375839175!3d10.72672264560429!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee58c723fb88d%3A0x57a0018745e1b06a!2sDHL%20Express%20Service%20Point%20(WWW%20EXPRESS%2FDHL%20EXPRESS)!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759746727578!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Dj5T44ZUXNfHua6d9', 'https://locator.dhl.com/results?address=id:MNLRJI&language=en&lc=PH&resultUom=km&clientAppCode=GYD', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Basement+1+Kiosk+B-02,+DHL+Express+Service+Point+(WWW+EXPRESS%2FDHL+EXPRESS),+Robinsons+Mall,+E+Lopez+St,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7267226,122.5179438,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee58c723fb88d:0x57a0018745e1b06a!2sDHL+Express+Service+Point+(WWW+EXPRESS%2FDHL+EXPRESS)!8m2!3d10.721014!4d122.5584358!16s%2Fg%2F11xzh1w2l0!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee58c723fb88d:0x57a0018745e1b06a!2m2!1d122.5584358!2d10.721014?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3', 'Monday - Sunday: 10 AM–8 PM', '09190647670', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'UNIT 1 - 616, BRGY, Carlos Uy Building, Mandurriao, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo\r\nDoor C Jose Chua Sing Bldg. Quezon, Corner Ledesma St, Iloilo City, 5000\r\nPH52+4PR, Senator Benigno S. Aquino Jr. Ave, Mandurriao, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo\r\n', 'https