(8, 'Jades Cargo Services, Inc.', 'uploads/img_68e5d906c5a316.55490436.png', 'uploads/img_68e5d906c5d551.86145224.png,uploads/img_68f90af9dee607.03847569.png', 'Jades Cargo Services, Inc. in Iloilo City is a logistics company offering a wide range of domestic and international shipping services, including air, sea, and land freight. They cater to both businesses and individuals with services like standard courier delivery, specialized trucking for bulk goods, warehousing, and door-to-door services throughout the Philippines. The Iloilo branch provides a local point of contact for these comprehensive logistics solutions to support the city\'s economy. ', '17 Iznart St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3989079.6003947435!2d119.82010334787452!3d12.477298260637408!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56f98a3bea5%3A0xe7c2719d77a01fd4!2sJades%20Cargo%20Services%2C%20Inc.%20-%20Iloilo%20Branch!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759747694287!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Lw8c5GNDkZpTD9zh8', 'https://jadescargo.ph/?fbclid=IwY2xjawNcO-VleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFjbjFwdE9sdDdJUlpxOGFlAR6_4Y6LTbcc-oXxX1t09UuCW9TmtLJjYH1WfeX5twth5SbxnUqhS_TUnasSpQ_aem_st_4ChfwzTpzTKMnjQ6U_Q', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Jades+Cargo+Services,+Inc.+-+Iloilo+Branch,+17+Iznart+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@12.4772983,119.8201033,7z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee56f98a3bea5:0xe7c2719d77a01fd4!2sJades+Cargo+Services,+Inc.+-+Iloilo+Branch!8m2!3d10.6912163!4d122.5689271!16s%2Fg%2F1hc764d3n!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee56f98a3bea5:0xe7c2719d77a01fd4!2m2!1d122.5689455!2d10.691216?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Monday - Saturday: 8 AM–5 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '0333363046 |  0933 862 2520', '', '', '', '', '', 'jades.iloilo@gmail.com', '', '', 'https://www.facebook.com/JCSIloilo/\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/jadescargo/?fbclid=IwY2xjawNcO-pleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFjbjFwdE9sdDdJUlpx