(7, 'Mang Inasal', 'uploads/Mang_Inasal.png', 'uploads/img_68e5cae9b926f2.59185999.png,uploads/img_68f8e49eb96cb2.36392241.png', 'At Mang Inasal, the Philippines’ Grill Expert, we have proudly served Filipinos and tourists from around the world with our signature Ihaw-Sarap (deliciously grilled) meals and Unli-Saya (unlimited fun) experiences for over 20 years.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOur journey began in Iloilo City at Robinsons Place Iloilo, where our founder, Edgar “Injap” Sia II, opened the very first Mang Inasal store on December 12, 2003 as a tribute to the grill masters who perfected the art of cooking Iloilo’s famous Chicken Inasal.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFrom the very start, we introduced the unbeatable combination of Chicken Inasal paired with Unli-Rice (unlimited rice), a first in the Philippine fast-food industry. This unique offering quickly won the hearts of customers nationwide and helped establish us as a fast-growing quick-service restaurant and a leading Filipino franchise.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nToday, you can enjoy your Mang Inasal favorites through dine-in, takeout, delivery, and drive-thru.', 'Unit#01333, Quezon St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d62723.33354209907!2d122.55559674260927!3d10.718407386283788!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56427fddb69%3A0x2eb9d5740bfe4319!2sMang%20Inasal%201st%20Store!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sph!4v1759330542192!5m2!1sen!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/89pnGpsEbwrihzYP8', 'http://www.manginasal.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Unit%2301333,+Mang+Inasal+1st+Store,+Quezon+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7184074,122.5555967,13z/data=!3m1!5s0x33aee5668216194d:0xcb267312637a41a0!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee56427fddb69:0x2eb9d5740bfe4319!2m2!1d122.5657401!2d10.6932116?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDkyOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', '0335080555', '[]', '', 'fast_food7.php', '[]', '2025-10-01 14:58:17', 'ICC GAISANO, Diversion Rd, Mandurriao, Iloi