(4, 'Mandaue Foam', 'uploads/Mandaue Foam.jpg', 'uploads/img_68f22a6e2217d2.06727614.jpg,uploads/img_68f8fa645e30d0.86587284.png', 'Mandaue Foam is a major furniture and home goods retailer in Iloilo, known for offering mattresses, sofas, frames, home décor, and related furniture products. The store operates multiple showrooms (e.g. Jaro, Pavia) to serve different parts of the city. It combines both product selection (a wide variety) and convenience: branches are open every day, email and customer service support are available, and deliveries/customizations are offered.', 'Pagsanga-an-Tacas-Quintin Salas Rd, Jaro, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31361.36707824575!2d122.52257014374642!3d10.721299573127917!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee4e9626c3d29%3A0x1195f658b8e73b9c!2sMandaue%20Foam%20-%20Jaro%20Branch!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1760329836634!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/rvGcpNFE4dK8nZoAA', 'https://mandauefoam.ph/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Mandaue+Foam+-+Jaro+Branch,+Pagsanga-an-Tacas-Quintin+Salas+Rd,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7212996,122.5225701,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee4e9626c3d29:0x1195f658b8e73b9c!2sMandaue+Foam+-+Jaro+Branch!8m2!3d10.7411319!4d122.5635365!16s%2Fg%2F1wfclpnb!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee4e9626c3d29:0x1195f658b8e73b9c!2m2!1d122.5635365!2d10.7411319?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Open Monday - Sunday: 10 AM to 6 PM', '(033) 336 4015  | (033) 320 3806 | cs.jaro@mandauefoam.ph', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/mandauefoam/', 'home_store4.php', '', '', 'General Luna St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, Iloilo', '', '2025-10-13 13:25:13', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"jeep5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"typ