(6, 'MoostBrand Home Depot', 'uploads/MoostBrand Home Depot.png', 'uploads/img_68f22ab6ed6950.03371297.png,uploads/img_68f8fa77a80c85.10211582.png', 'Moostbrand Home Depot is a large-scale home improvement superstore.It is part of Moostbrand, Inc., an Ilonggo company which started in the 1980s as a small hardware store and has since grown into a trusted provider of home architectural, building, and furnishing materials. Their offerings include a wide variety of products: tiles, bathroom and plumbing fixtures, hardware, electrical and lighting fixtures, furniture, home décor, kitchen accessories, houseware, wood, doors and mouldings, and garden essentials. They cater both to homeowners doing renovations / home builds, as well as contractors and DIY enthusiasts.', '168 R4, Jaro, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31359.153332546284!2d122.52720017431638!3d10.74263950000001!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee4923474dd0d%3A0x9a76731904641ffc!2sMoostBrand%20Home%20Depot!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1760329914455!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/7Y1bAzXi8gnsSf8r7', 'https://www.moostbrand.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//MoostBrand+Home+Depot,+168+R4,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7426395,122.5272002,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee4923474dd0d:0x9a76731904641ffc!2sMoostBrand+Home+Depot!8m2!3d10.7494325!4d122.5687226!16s%2Fg%2F1tf9vz1z!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee4923474dd0d:0x9a76731904641ffc!2m2!1d122.5689108!2d10.7493132?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Monday - Saturday: 8:30 AM – 7:00 PM\r\nSunday: 8:30 AM – 5:30 PM', '(033) 329 3588  |  (033) 508-6135  | +63 917-626-2263  | +63 991-900-8308', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/moostbrand/', 'home_store6.php', '', '', '', '', '2025-10-13 13:26:29', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep10.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus10.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"Route 18: TAGBAK TO CITY PROPER VIA COASTAL\",\"link\":\"bus18.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 21: TAGBAK \\/ BUNTATALA TO FESTIVE WALK VIA SM CITY \\/ ATRIA\",\"link\":\"bus21.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]'),
(7, 'UNITOP', 'uploads/UNITOP.jpg', 'uploads/img_68f22ad3e3e511.31300097.jpg,uploads/img_68f8fa8160b1c6.67322546.png', 'UNITOP is a popular general merchandise & department store in Iloilo City, with multiple branches including at Iznart-Ledesma and Nonoy. It offers a broad assortment of home-and-lifestyle products—everything from kitchenware, furniture, appliances, to daily essentials—catering to value-conscious shoppers. The pricing tends to be more affordable compared to high-end stores, which is why UNITOP is frequently chosen for home goods, bulk purchases, and general household needs.', 'Ledesma St. cor. Iznart St., Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31363.941459432146!2d122.53034267431636!3d10.696430299999996!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56f80c4af97%3A0xc4b3339a1fc0b04c!2sUNITOP!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1760329940350!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/NtcBvPUrqJdvBdgJ8', '', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//UNITOP,+Ledesma+St.+cor.+Iznart+St.,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.6964303,122.5303427,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee56f80c4af97:0xc4b3339a1fc0b04c!2sUNITOP!8m2!3d10.6964303!4d122.5684515!16s%2Fg%2F1tpc5hwm!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee56f80c4af97:0xc4b3339a1fc0b04c!2m2!1d122.5684579!2d10.6964145?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Open Monday - Tuesday: 9:00 AM - 6:30 PM\r\nWednesday - Sunday: 8:00 AM - 6:30 PM', '0917 791 7695 | unitop20@gmail.com', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Unitop-Gen-Mdse-Inc-Iloilo-100064134335469/', 'home_store7.php', '', '', '', '', '2025-10-13 13:27:05', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"jeep2.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{