(11, 'MOOSTBRAND', 'uploads/MOOSTBRAND.jpg', 'uploads/img_68f22c2eba56e0.55771140.jpg,uploads/img_68f8faab0c8780.29507753.png', 'Moostbrand Home Depot is a large-scale home improvement superstore.It is part of Moostbrand, Inc., an Ilonggo company which started in the 1980s as a small hardware store and has since grown into a trusted provider of home architectural, building, and furnishing materials. Their offerings include a wide variety of products: tiles, bathroom and plumbing fixtures, hardware, electrical and lighting fixtures, furniture, home décor, kitchen accessories, houseware, wood, doors and mouldings, and garden essentials. They cater both to homeowners doing renovations / home builds, as well as contractors and DIY enthusiasts.', '5 Valeria St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31364.278723058716!2d122.5298175743164!3d10.693168000000004!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56e852fb2db%3A0x700bc8c5ac7fb658!2sMOOSTBRAND!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1760330091007!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/JMeRTaRz2ZSUFM8K6', 'https://www.moostbrand.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//MOOSTBRAND,+5+Valeria+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.693168,122.5298176,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee56e852fb2db:0x700bc8c5ac7fb658!2sMOOSTBRAND!8m2!3d10.7007815!4d122.5679079!16s%2Fg%2F1t_kd148!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee56e852fb2db:0x700bc8c5ac7fb658!2m2!1d122.5678441!2d10.700779?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Monday - Saturday: 8:30 AM – 7:00 PM\r\nSunday: 8:30 AM – 5:30 PM', '(033) 329 3588 |  (033) 508-6135  | +63 917-626-2263  | +63 991-900-8308', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/moostbrand/', 'home_store11.php', '', '', '', '', '2025-10-13 13:29:33', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WA