(15, 'Furniture Republic', 'uploads/Furniture Republic.jpg', 'uploads/img_68f22d47b2a2d9.65784042.jpg,uploads/img_68f8fad3affce7.83987273.png', 'Furniture Republic is a Philippine furniture retailer offering a wide range of home furnishings—living room, bedroom, dining, office, outdoor, décor, lighting, etc.  Known for blending style and function, they emphasize quality craftsmanship, on-trend designs, and customer convenience. Their services often go beyond just selling furniture: many branches include delivery, installation/assembly, and after-sales support. As part of their branding, they promote a “stress-free furnishing experience” by helping customers with layout, delivery logistics, and setup.', 'Megaworld Blvd, Mandurriao, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31361.71592004989!2d122.50879177431645!3d10.717933000000015!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee57a96d7b465%3A0x4d8cd3c0329f2c38!2sFurniture%20Republic!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1760330196026!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/yLnE1RX4QT8vzBg5A', 'https://www.furniture-republic.com.ph/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Furniture+Republic,+Megaworld+Blvd,+Mandurriao,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.717933,122.5087918,14z/data=!3m1!5s0x33aee53048cc7611:0x5607c5cfb7088b7e!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee57a96d7b465:0x4d8cd3c0329f2c38!2sFurniture+Republic!8m2!3d10.7171486!4d122.5459998!16s%2Fg%2F11j1j7ng9c!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee57a96d7b465:0x4d8cd3c0329f2c38!2m2!1d122.5459998!2d10.7171486?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Open Monday - Saturday: 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '(02 )8899 9000 | furniturerepublic.info@gmail.com', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/FurnitureRepublicPH/', 'home_store15.php', '', '', '', '', '2025-10-13 13:32:06', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE 