(17, 'Asian Home', 'uploads/Asian Home.jpg', 'uploads/img_68f22da6107122.87295183.jpg,uploads/img_68f8faeb126c15.26149123.png', 'Asian Home Appliance is a major home electronics & appliance retailer in Iloilo City. They offer a wide range of home appliances (kitchen, audio/video, household electronics), and accessories. The store is part of a national chain (Asian Home Appliance), which has many branches across Visayas and Mindanao. Customers can visit the store physically, or order via their website. It’s a go-to store for appliance needs in Iloilo, especially for those looking for reliable brands, promotions (like payment-plans).', 'Festive Walk Mall, Megaworld Blvd, Mandurriao, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31361.71592004989!2d122.50879177431645!3d10.717933000000015!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5c93d3590bd%3A0x3c5abf460d5996bd!2sAsian%20Home!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1760330290402!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/3pcgJL8QbW39F1tv6', 'https://www.asianhomeappliance.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Asian+Home,+Megaworld+Blvd,+Mandurriao,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.717933,122.5087918,14z/data=!3m1!5s0x33aee53048cc7611:0x5607c5cfb7088b7e!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee5c93d3590bd:0x3c5abf460d5996bd!2sAsian+Home!8m2!3d10.7164404!4d122.5458772!16s%2Fg%2F11flbd0frs!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee5c93d3590bd:0x3c5abf460d5996bd!2m2!1d122.5458772!2d10.7164404?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Open Monday - Sunday:  10:00 AM - 10:00 PM', '(033) 320 0457 | sales@asianhomeappliance.com', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/asianhomeappliance', 'home_store17.php', '', '', '', '', '2025-10-13 13:33:04', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"jeep5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"