(3, 'Edwin Reyes Meat Shop', 'Selling quality and affordable meat and other frozen products.\r\nEdwin Reyes Meat Shop, also known as ED Meatshop, is a meat retailer in Iloilo City that offers a variety of beef and pork products, and provides specialized meat-cutting and deboning services. ', 'MGJJ+863, Villa Arevalo District, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'uploads/img_68ef37a4d936e3.58875020.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ef37a4d9af93.08926531.jpg,uploads/img_68f8ee2bc87d61.92868702.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d250924.7425881609!2d122.21291443761751!3d10.680447510648044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aef10031cc2097%3A0xed7120954c92dcc3!2sEdwin%20Reyes%20Meat%20Shop!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1760323845343!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Sg3oTBVsUprWdbZA6', '', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//MGJJ%2B863+Edwin+Reyes+Meat+Shop,+Villa+Arevalo+District,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.6804475,122.2129144,11z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aef10031cc2097:0xed7120954c92dcc3!2sEdwin+Reyes+Meat+Shop!8m2!3d10.680774!4d122.5305484!16s', 'Monday - Sunday: 6:00AM -11:30AM - 4:00 PM- 8:00PM', '09193145444 | 0907 973 3568', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Eds-Meatshop-61575759560772/', '', 'meat_shop3.php', '2025-10-13 12:10:33', '2026-04-02 11:11:03', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 9: MOHON TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep9.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep10.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":