(7, 'Healthlink', 'uploads/Healthlink.jpg', 'uploads/img_68f2329e39d2a7.53875144.jpg,uploads/img_68f8dcb6161a56.76445492.png', 'HEALTHLINK (ILOILO) INC. is a medical, surgical, dental clinics and diagnostic center that offers quality and affordable comprehensive healthcare services. Since its incorporation in 2004, the company has now grown to ten (10) branches and has become one of the leading healthcare service providers in the region. Healthlink is home to about 80 medical and dental specialists, who are established experts in their various fields of specialization. These core of professionals is complemented by equally competent human resource dedicated to quality and excellent customer service.\r\n\r\nHEALTHLINK (ILOILO) INC. is accredited by the Department of Health (DOH), and Philippine Overseas Employment Agency (POEA). It is also certified by the Philippine Council on Accreditation of Health Care Organizations (PCAHO), the Philippines\' most esteemed accrediting body for quality standard systems of medical clinics for overseas Filipino workers. It also partners with reputable Health Maintenance Organizations (HMOs) to deliver excellent healthcare service to corporate and individual clients.\r\n\r\nFor your healthcare needs,come and visit your best link to health, HEALTHLINK(ILOILO) INC.', 'Mabini St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.4627069326802!2d122.56203157504072!3d10.698749289445377!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee51239f6d225%3A0xad8a68c2e0d0d5cb!2sHealthlink%20(Iloilo)%2C%20Inc.!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1760105304715!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/2bv84HGDr8sNVFGy7', 'https://healthlinkiloilo.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Healthlink+(Iloilo),+Inc.,+Mabini+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.6987493,122.5646065,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee51239f6d225:0xad8a68c2e0d0d5cb!2sHealthlink+(Iloilo),+Inc.!8m2!3d10.6987493!4d1