(3, 'Cebuana Lhuilier  ', 'uploads/img_68e5d366369dd8.42953514.jpg', 'uploads/img_68e5d36636e323.82900245.jpg,uploads/img_68f8bbc9e0c4d2.46536371.png', 'Cebuana Lhuillier Jewelry is the name to remember in pre-loved jewelry retail. Backed by the household brand of Cebuana Lhuillier, we aim to cater to the gold and jewelry needs of Filipinos who know our way of business, and know their worth.\r\n\r\nCebuana Lhuillier was first established in 1953, under the name Agencia Cebuana. As the company grew into the leading microfinancial services of the country, Cebuana Lhuillier became a trusted name for Filipinos ever in matters of loans, insurance, banking services, pawning, and other financial solutions. Naturally, Cebuana Lhuillier would expand its vision while staying true to its mission by delving into gold and jewelry while reaching out to an online audience. Today, Cebuana Lhuilllier Jewelry is recognized as a trusted seller of gold and jewelry and a go-to purveyor of pre-loved luxury pieces.\r\n\r\nBusiness Promises\r\nCebuana Lhuillier Jewelry is your go-to destination for matters of authentic, pawnable gold and jewelry. We promise insured delivery of your purchases, while providing top-notch customer support every step of the way.', '309 Simon Ledesma Street, Jaro, Iloilo City, 5000', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d62728.42806915639!2d122.49461358492391!3d10.693793798116772!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee523f8cda555%3A0xe2ef3856328aacc6!2sCebuana%20Lhuillier%20Pawnshop%20-%20Jaro%203!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759204649991!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/be17brrc4kt9GXhp8', 'https://www.cebuanalhuillier.com/', '', 'Monday 8:00AM-6:00?PM\r\nTuesday 8:00AM-6:00?PM\r\nWednesday 8:00AM-6:00?PM\r\nThursday 8:00AM-6:00?PM\r\nFriday 8:00AM-6:00?PM\r\nSaturday 8:00AM-6:00?PM\r\nSunday 8:00AM-6:00?PM', '+639693000059', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'support.cljewelry@pjlhuillier.com', '', 'Jaro 3 Branch - 309 Simon Ledesma 