(4, 'Multi-Print Printing & Supply', 'uploads/Multi-Print Printing & Supply.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ecdc9523bcf8.96248454.jpg,uploads/img_68f88e64d25075.34492664.png', 'Multi‑Print Printing & Supply is one of the accredited printing supply businesses in Iloilo City. They appear to supply printing supplies, possibly also providing printing services. Given their business name, they likely carry materials (paper, inks, etc.) and may do in‑house printing support. They serve clients that need printing supplies and smaller print jobs, and because they are registered and accredited under the government’s printer accreditation (RDO No. 074), they likely handle official receipts or similar work.', 'Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.540840819689!2d122.56363167504074!3d10.692703589451062!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5641a7aaad5%3A0x687b6df9c300ac54!2sMulti%20Print%20Printing%20%26%20Supply!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759745121805!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/j6L7jDznDxJAV5q59', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Multi+Print+Printing+%26+Supply,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.6927036,122.5662066,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee5641a7aaad5:0x687b6df9c300ac54!2sMulti+Print+Printing+%26+Supply!8m2!3d10.6927036!4d122.5662066!16s%2Fg%2F11c5xvhm2c!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee5641a7aaad5:0x687b6df9c300ac54!2m2!1d122.5662066!2d10.6927036?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Open Monday - Friday: 7:00 AM - 7:00 PM', '(033) 335 0532', '[]', '', 'printing_services4.php', '[]', '', '2025-10-07 07:28:09', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 9: MOHON TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep9.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 15: MOLO TO CITY PROPER VIA BULAURTE\",\"link\":\"jeep1