(5, 'Hometown Printing Press', 'uploads/Hometown Printing Press.png', 'uploads/img_68ecdca09f2bc0.94159125.png,uploads/img_68f88e72a8be25.43475391.png', 'Hometown Printing Press is a stationery, printing, and office support business in Jaro, Iloilo City. Located in G Building along M.V. Hechanova, the shop provides printing, document preparation, photocopying, and possibly office supply services. Given its accreditation status, it is capable of issuing official receipts/invoices. The business serves both personal clients (students, individuals) and business clients needing printing and stationery solutions. With standard business hours through the week (closed Sundays), it offers reliable access in the mornings through late afternoons.', 'Door 2, G. Building, M.V. Hechanova, Jaro, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3919.8467158994795!2d122.56464067504147!3d10.74629458940062!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee491dde90aff%3A0x54631bedac0aff63!2sHometown%20Printing%20Press!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759745206823!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/x8B8uYmtEE2ijtkU7', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Door+2,+Hometown+Printing+Press,+G.+Building,+M.V.+Hechanova,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7462946,122.5672156,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee491dde90aff:0x54631bedac0aff63!2sHometown+Printing+Press!8m2!3d10.7462946!4d122.5672156!16s%2Fg%2F1pztsfy4n!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee491dde90aff:0x54631bedac0aff63!2m2!1d122.5672156!2d10.7462946?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Open Monday - Saturday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM \r\nSunday: Closed', '(033) 329 1885', '[]', '', 'printing_services5.php', '[]', '', '2025-10-07 07:28:42', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\