(8, 'Jeric Dave Copy Center (Magdalo)', 'uploads/Jeric Dave Copy Center (Magdalo).jpg', 'uploads/img_68ecdcc87a6243.57568816.jpg,uploads/img_68f88e915cd3d5.82920719.png', 'Jeric Dave Copy Center is a printing and photocopy shop in Iloilo City with at least two branches (Magdalo, La Paz and a West branch in Jaro). Managed by Jeric Dave (Jed) Gallardo, the shop offers fast, quality printing, photocopying, binding (including thesis/hardbound), laminating, and other related document finishing services. Their services are popular among students and businesses that need theses, handouts, or official documents reproduced with good binding and visual quality. The West branch is listed as being open 24 hours, making it a convenient option for urgent or after‑hours print needs.', 'Magdalo St, La Paz, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d7840.551214016592!2d122.55979179146917!3d10.713212657726677!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee513db8aac27%3A0x423d345227120eed!2sJeric%20Dave%20Copy%20Center%20(Magdalo)!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759745329900!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/fydN218MQFhs9tT59', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Jeric+Dave+Copy+Center+(Magdalo),+Magdalo+St,+La+Paz,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7132127,122.5597918,16z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee513db8aac27:0x423d345227120eed!2sJeric+Dave+Copy+Center+(Magdalo)!8m2!3d10.71093!4d122.567324!16s%2Fg%2F11c5t231p9!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee513db8aac27:0x423d345227120eed!2m2!1d122.567324!2d10.71093?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Open Monday - Sunday: 7:00 AM-7:00 PM', '0927‑180‑3793 | jdcopyc@gmail.com', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/jericdavecopycenter/', 'printing_services8.php', '[]', '', '2025-10-07 07:31:07', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"jeep2.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 15: MOLO TO CITY PROPER VIA BULAURTE\