(2, 'Ear Math & Science Review & Tutorial Center', 'Ear Math & Science Review & Tutorial Center specializes in providing comprehensive tutoring and review programs for students in Iloilo. We focus on Math and Science subjects, helping students strengthen their understanding and skills to excel in their exams and academic endeavors. Whether you\'re preparing for competitive entrance exams, national standardized tests, or just need extra help in school subjects, our experienced tutors will guide you every step of the way. At Ear Math & Science, we take a personalized approach to learning, ensuring each student achieves their full potential.', 'Solid Building, Corner Diversion San Rafael Road, Mandurriao, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'uploads/Ear Math & Science Review & Tutorial Center.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed1785e44589.41523026.jpg,uploads/img_68f7af9da58a36.02658839.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31362.61796203163!2d122.51299997431641!3d10.709222800000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee538615822af%3A0x5844c50e7b54294d!2sEar%20Math%20%26%20Science%20Review%20%26%20Tutorial%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759755843071!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/cHShchSuQ5TBAULJ7', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Ear+Math+%26+Science+Review+%26+Tutorial+Center,+Solid+Building,+Corner+Diversion+San+Rafael+Road,+Mandurriao,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7092228,122.513,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee538615822af:0x5844c50e7b54294d!2sEar+Math+%26+Science+Review+%26+Tutorial+Center!8m2!3d10.7092228!4d122.5511088!16s%2Fg%2F11c5h1__ss!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee538615822af:0x5844c50e7b54294d!2m2!1d122.5510813!2d10.7092827?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Open Monday - Saturday: 8:00 AM-6:00 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '0917 722 2616', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/learnwithear/', 'review_center2.php', '[]', 'ear.review.center@gmail.com', '2025-10-07 14:26:20', '2026-02-28 06:37:24', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\