(3, 'QR TRAINING CENTER (Quality Review)', 'QR TRAINING CENTER (Quality Review) is dedicated to providing top-notch review and training services for students and professionals preparing for various exams. Our center offers specialized review programs in different fields, ensuring that every participant receives a comprehensive and structured learning experience. With a focus on quality, we utilize modern teaching methods and expert instructors to help students achieve their goals. Whether you\'re preparing for licensure exams, entrance tests, or certifications, QR TRAINING CENTER ensures you are equipped with the knowledge and skills necessary to succeed.', '3rd Floor, NB Bldg, Lopez Jaena St, Jaro, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'uploads/QR TRAINING CENTER (Quality Review).jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed17976746d5.45033081.jpg,uploads/img_68f7afa88eee24.47195406.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31362.61796203163!2d122.51299997431641!3d10.709222800000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee514acd778eb%3A0x1254126821e699b3!2sQR%20TRAINING%20CENTER%20(Quality%20Review)!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759755901391!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/MWijDfSrVwTNzzFPA', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//3rd+Floor,+QR+TRAINING+CENTER+(Quality+Review),+NB+Bldg,+Lopez+Jaena+St,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7092228,122.513,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee514acd778eb:0x1254126821e699b3!2sQR+TRAINING+CENTER+(Quality+Review)!8m2!3d10.7260426!4d122.5565124!16s%2Fg%2F11fl406d18!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee514acd778eb:0x1254126821e699b3!2m2!1d122.5565736!2d10.726086?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM-5:00 PM \r\nSaturday:  9:00 AM - 3:00 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '0920 397 3964', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/QR-JJ-Review-and-Training-Center-100063824806260/', 'review_center3.php', '[]', 'qrtrainingcenter@gmail.com', '2025-10-07 14:26:56', '2026-02-28 06:39:07', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":