(5, 'Padilla Review Center Iloilo', 'Padilla Review Center Iloilo is a trusted institution providing comprehensive review programs aimed at helping students achieve academic success. Whether you’re preparing for entrance exams, board exams, or other academic challenges, our expert instructors and tailored study plans are designed to give you the edge you need. At Padilla Review Center, we believe in creating a positive and motivating environment that empowers students to not only pass their exams but excel in them. With years of experience and proven results, we are your partner in preparing for a brighter future.', 'Across YMCA, 4th Flr. TCT Center, Iznart St, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'uploads/Padilla Review Center Iloilo.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed17bf1126d8.20135914.jpg,uploads/img_68f7afc719e9e9.82178400.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31362.61796203163!2d122.51299997431641!3d10.709222800000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5af64898fd3%3A0xbb318d68c07fdbbf!2sPadilla%20Review%20Center%20Iloilo!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759755949787!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/aVsgaXUxCvCLnqYi8', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Padilla+Review+Center+Iloilo,+Across+YMCA,+4th+Flr.+TCT+Center,+Iznart+St,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7092228,122.513,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee5af64898fd3:0xbb318d68c07fdbbf!2sPadilla+Review+Center+Iloilo!8m2!3d10.6961451!4d122.5692051!16s%2Fg%2F11mv1l_92t!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee5af64898fd3:0xbb318d68c07fdbbf!2m2!1d122.5692084!2d10.6961447?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 6:00 PM \r\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 3:00 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '0922 877 7211', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Padilla-Review-Center-Engineering-100064572766526/', 'review_center5.php', '[]', '', '2025-10-07 14:28:46', '2026-02-28 06:44:26', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\"