(6, 'Concept Engineering Review and Training Center', 'Concept Engineering Review and Training Center specializes in providing high-quality review and training programs tailored to aspiring engineers. Whether you\'re preparing for licensure exams or pursuing further education, we offer structured courses designed to enhance your knowledge and problem-solving skills in core engineering concepts. Our experienced instructors and comprehensive study materials ensure that every student gains a deep understanding of engineering principles. At Concept Engineering, we focus on providing practical, hands-on learning experiences that will empower you to excel in exams and your engineering career.', 'Ledesma, Brgy. Gloria, Jalandoni St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'uploads/Concept Engineering Review and Training Center.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed17d36091f3.37701331.jpg,uploads/img_68f7afd15e31f1.52728933.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31362.61796203163!2d122.51299997431641!3d10.709222800000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56771861be3%3A0xb4b6919f17219bcd!2sConcept%20Engineering%20Review%20and%20Training%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759755975517!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/D9dPRQL6EW9SbdYY7', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Concept+Engineering+Review+and+Training+Center,+Ledesma,+Brgy.+Gloria,+Jalandoni+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7092228,122.513,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee56771861be3:0xb4b6919f17219bcd!2sConcept+Engineering+Review+and+Training+Center!8m2!3d10.6941335!4d122.5618152!16s%2Fg%2F11xyhn7vzq!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee56771861be3:0xb4b6919f17219bcd!2m2!1d122.5618044!2d10.6941335?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Open Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\r\nSaturday & Sunday: Closed', '0916-541-7302', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Concept-Engineering-Review-Center-61556548944416/', 'review_center6.php', '[]', 'conceptenginee