(7, 'Mind Point Review and Training Center', 'Mind Point Review and Training Center is dedicated to providing expert-led review sessions and training programs for students and professionals looking to elevate their academic and career prospects. Whether you\'re preparing for licensure exams, school entrance tests, or skill-based certifications, Mind Point combines proven strategies with expert guidance to ensure you are fully prepared. We offer a wide range of subjects, and our flexible schedule allows us to cater to the individual learning needs of each student. At Mind Point, we believe that with the right mindset and preparation, every student can unlock their full potential.', 'MHX3+R94, MH del Pilar St, Molo, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'uploads/Mind Point Review and Training Center.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed17e4954125.76085245.jpg,uploads/img_68f7afdb80dc82.31529272.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31362.61796203163!2d122.51299997431641!3d10.709222800000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee544c2dda7ab%3A0x7db55f5e91441a22!2sMind%20Point%20Review%20and%20Training%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759755999371!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/S8F6Tzy4jQ2cXjfs8', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//MHX3%2BR94+Mind+Point+Review+and+Training+Center,+MH+del+Pilar+St,+Molo,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7092228,122.513,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee544c2dda7ab:0x7db55f5e91441a22!2sMind+Point+Review+and+Training+Center!8m2!3d10.6995083!4d122.5534562!16s%2Fg%2F12qfn9lf1!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee544c2dda7ab:0x7db55f5e91441a22!2m2!1d122.5534558!2d10.6995115?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Monday - Saturday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '+63 916 432 1098  | (033) 300 1198', '[]', '', 'review_center7.php', '[]', '', '2025-10-07 14:29:57', '2026-02-28 06:51:48', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type