(8, 'iMath Review and Tutorial Hub', 'iMath Review and Tutorial Hub is dedicated to helping students build strong foundations in mathematics, offering specialized review and tutorial services for all levels. Whether you\'re struggling with basic math concepts or preparing for advanced exams like entrance tests, SATs, or board exams, we provide personalized instruction to help you succeed. Our team of expert tutors uses a variety of methods, ensuring each student’s learning style is addressed. At iMath, we believe that with the right guidance and a clear understanding of math principles, any student can achieve academic excellence.', 'Donato Pison Ave, Mandurriao, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'uploads/iMath Review and Tutorial Hub.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed17f95f43d9.07309504.jpg,uploads/img_68f7afe593c7c8.47035329.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31362.61796203163!2d122.51299997431641!3d10.709222800000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee59f21aa2a6b%3A0x4c225781b2cc2c82!2siMath%20Review%20and%20Tutorial%20Hub!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759756022086!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/oRGHZJJcVjggrvb49', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//iMath+Review+and+Tutorial+Hub,+Donato+Pison+Ave,+Mandurriao,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7092228,122.513,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee59f21aa2a6b:0x4c225781b2cc2c82!2siMath+Review+and+Tutorial+Hub!8m2!3d10.7091922!4d122.5508913!16s%2Fg%2F11h4qm7vfv!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee59f21aa2a6b:0x4c225781b2cc2c82!2m2!1d122.5508895!2d10.7091949?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Monday - Friday: 9:00 AM - 7:00 PM\r\nSaturday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '0920 910 9177', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/iMathReviewAndTutorialHub/', 'review_center8.php', '[]', 'imath.iloilo@gmail.com', '2025-10-07 14:30:21', '2026-02-28 06:53:47', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},