(9, 'DaTSMILe Review and Tutorial Center', 'DaTSMILe Review and Tutorial Center is committed to providing high-quality review and tutorial services, helping students of all ages and academic levels reach their full potential. Specializing in personalized academic support, we offer tailored programs for entrance exams, licensure tests, and specialized subject areas. At DaTSMILe, we prioritize building a positive and engaging learning environment where students are empowered to excel. Our expert instructors utilize modern teaching techniques and custom lesson plans to ensure that each student not only understands the material but also builds the confidence needed for success.', 'PHQ7+H4H, Jaro, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'uploads/DaTSMILe Review and Tutorial Center.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed180b4aeca5.69477796.jpg,uploads/img_68f7afef450cb5.42138715.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31359.53716076899!2d122.5247597743164!3d10.738942499999997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee594db97b109%3A0xec59f06e05f65daa!2sDaTSMILe%20Review%20and%20Tutorial%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759756048936!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/KfmYnLY3hwETtxEW7', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//PHQ7%2BH4H+DaTSMILe+Review+and+Tutorial+Center,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7389425,122.5247598,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee594db97b109:0xec59f06e05f65daa!2sDaTSMILe+Review+and+Tutorial+Center!8m2!3d10.7389425!4d122.5628686!16s%2Fg%2F11jh7cqmg_!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee594db97b109:0xec59f06e05f65daa!2m2!1d122.562846!2d10.7389549?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Monday - Saturday: 9:00 AM - 8:00 PM  \r\nSunday: Closed', '0921 457 6726', '[]', '', 'review_center9.php', '[]', '', '2025-10-07 14:31:22', '2026-02-28 06:55:53', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 2: VILLA PLAZA TO CITY PROPER VIA CALUMPANG\",\"link\":\"jeep2.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CP