(10, 'Amici Review Center IloIlo', 'Amici Review Center Iloilo is committed to helping students reach their full academic potential through expert-led review programs tailored to individual needs. Whether you are preparing for entrance exams, board exams, or need supplemental support in specific subjects, Amici provides comprehensive review sessions designed for success. Our dedicated team of educators creates a positive and motivating environment that encourages academic excellence. With flexible schedules and personalized plans, we ensure every student is well-equipped to face any academic challenge with confidence.', '168 J De Leon St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'uploads/Amici Review Center IloIlo.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed181ce8e301.42960830.jpg,uploads/img_68f7aff975ef20.75374675.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31364.231772973624!2d122.52926687431642!3d10.6936222!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee584f6c90c1b%3A0xe86691cb2ad2f96f!2sAmici%20Review%20Center%20IloIlo!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759756066918!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/xXxwSpkLFonFgyay5', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Amici+Review+Center+IloIlo,+168+J+De+Leon+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.6932887,122.565875,17.5z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee584f6c90c1b:0xe86691cb2ad2f96f!2sAmici+Review+Center+IloIlo!8m2!3d10.6936222!4d122.5673757!16s%2Fg%2F11ksst5yp5!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee584f6c90c1b:0xe86691cb2ad2f96f!2m2!1d122.5673751!2d10.693631?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'https://amicireviewcenter.com/', 'Monday - Sunday:  8:00 AM - 5:00 PM', '0977 258 7935', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Amici-Review-Center-Iloilo-100093254419474/', 'review_center10.php', '[]', 'amicireviewcenter@gmail.com', '2025-10-07 14:32:10', '2026-02-28 06:56:59', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"