(12, 'Gold Rank Review Center Iloilo', 'Gold Rank Review Center Iloilo is dedicated to helping students unlock their full academic potential through high-quality review programs tailored to their specific needs. Whether preparing for entrance exams, board exams, or other important assessments, we provide expert-led sessions designed to maximize your performance and confidence. Our skilled instructors focus on personalized learning strategies and offer comprehensive materials to ensure every student is well-equipped to excel. At Gold Rank, we aim to help you achieve not just success, but a Gold standard of excellence.', 'Lolita Building, General Luna St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'uploads/Gold Rank Review Center Iloilo.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed18432ca1f0.17180284.jpg,uploads/img_68f7b0dc7f5da3.83112515.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31364.231772973624!2d122.52926687431642!3d10.6936222!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5da8f3e09af%3A0xe7830becb8f06ad8!2sGold%20Rank%20Review%20Center%20Iloilo!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759756121186!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/FsM37kWpTEgqUJK4A', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Gold+Rank+Review+Center+Iloilo,+Lolita+Building,+General+Luna+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7010817,122.5649721,17.5z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee5da8f3e09af:0xe7830becb8f06ad8!2sGold+Rank+Review+Center+Iloilo!8m2!3d10.7010698!4d122.5662677!16s%2Fg%2F11v56kcfwl!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee5da8f3e09af:0xe7830becb8f06ad8!2m2!1d122.5662677!2d10.7010698?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Monday - Friday: 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM \r\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '+63 917 123 4567', '[]', '', 'review_center12.php', '[]', 'goldrankreviewiloilo@gmail.com', '2025-10-07 14:33:59', '2026-02-28 07:03:08', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\