(13, 'Uno Review and Tutorial Center', 'Uno Review and Tutorial Center is your go-to destination for expert-led review sessions and academic tutorials. We specialize in providing top-quality preparation for entrance exams, licensure exams, and school subjects. With a focus on individual learning styles, we create customized review programs to ensure that every student is fully prepared to succeed. Our experienced tutors use effective teaching methods and materials to build confidence and help students achieve their academic goals. At Uno, we believe that success is within reach—together, we can make it happen.', 'General Luna St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'uploads/Uno Review and Tutorial Center.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed1853b22de2.58541140.jpg,uploads/img_68f7b0e6be1b07.10865763.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31364.231772973624!2d122.52926687431642!3d10.6936222!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee538a08baae1%3A0xc97729cbc7330838!2sUno%20Review%20and%20Tutorial%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759756148379!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Kz3QNTBiiFazbDSV6', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Uno+Review+and+Tutorial+Center,+General+Luna+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.6936222,122.5292669,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee538a08baae1:0xc97729cbc7330838!2sUno+Review+and+Tutorial+Center!8m2!3d10.7002472!4d122.5606193!16s%2Fg%2F11trqy46xb!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee538a08baae1:0xc97729cbc7330838!2m2!1d122.5606212!2d10.7002308?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Monday - Saturday: 9:00AM-5:00PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '0928 992 9258', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Uno-Review-and-Tutorial-Center-Iloilo-100065031429667/', 'review_center13.php', '[]', 'unoreviewandtutorialcenter2023@gmail.com', '2025-10-07 14:34:36', '2026-02-28 07:06:57', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"ty