(16, 'Brightmate Tutorial Center', 'Brightmate Tutorial Center is dedicated to guiding students through their academic challenges with expert-led tutorials and review programs. Whether you’re preparing for exams, improving your grades in specific subjects, or needing personalized one-on-one tutoring, Brightmate offers tailored services that cater to every student’s needs. Our professional tutors are committed to providing engaging, clear, and effective lessons that make learning easier and more enjoyable. At Brightmate, we believe every student has the potential to shine, and we are here to help light the way to success.', 'Red House l Beside Tinukib Cafe, 26 M. Jayme St, Jaro, 5000 Iloilo', 'uploads/Brightmate Tutorial Center.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed18c03aa7c0.17071946.jpg,uploads/img_68f7b105e43d96.49843486.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31361.292600640736!2d122.5223418743164!3d10.722018200000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee552e6b341fb%3A0x1eeaf20cbd114a35!2sBrightmate%20Tutorial%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759756217594!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/pS1u6H7gEMtxiFfKA', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Brightmate+Tutorial+Center,+Red+House+l+Beside+Tinukib+Cafe,+26+M.+Jayme+St,+Jaro,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7220182,122.5223419,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee552e6b341fb:0x1eeaf20cbd114a35!2sBrightmate+Tutorial+Center!8m2!3d10.7220182!4d122.5604507!16s%2Fg%2F11vpflqgg2!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee552e6b341fb:0x1eeaf20cbd114a35!2m2!1d122.5604507!2d10.7220182?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', 'Monday - Sunday: 8:30 AM - 9:00 PM', '0907 407 1805', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/Brightmate-Tutorial-Center-100057038456837/', 'review_center16.php', '[]', 'brightmatetutorial@gmail.com', '2025-10-07 14:36:22', '2026-02-28 07:15:33', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\"