(17, 'ATLAS Iloilo - Online Maritime Review Center for Marine Deck & Engine Officers', 'ATLAS Iloilo is an online review center dedicated to providing top-tier review programs for Marine Deck and Engine Officers. Our comprehensive and specialized courses are designed to help maritime professionals excel in their licensure exams and advance their careers. With a team of experienced maritime instructors, we offer flexible online sessions that allow students to learn at their own pace while still receiving expert guidance. ATLAS focuses on the unique needs of marine officers, ensuring that every student is thoroughly prepared for both theoretical and practical exams. Sail towards success with ATLAS Iloilo, where we chart the course to your professional growth.', 'J. M Basa Street Plaza Libertad, Downtown, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', 'uploads/atlas.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed19bae87d52.93530341.jpg,uploads/img_68f7b1101326f4.52086991.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31361.292600640736!2d122.5223418743164!3d10.722018200000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee544ea40c90f%3A0x91322d4e8dfcf306!2sATLAS%20Iloilo%20-%20Online%20Maritime%20Review%20Center%20for%20Marine%20Deck%20%26%20Engine%20Officers!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759756246338!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/TnKMd7NujcNsVwbEA', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//ATLAS+Iloilo+-+Online+Maritime+Review+Center+for+Marine+Deck+%26+Engine+Officers,+J.+M+Basa+Street+Plaza+Libertad,+Downtown,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7220182,122.5223419,14z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee544ea40c90f:0x91322d4e8dfcf306!2sATLAS+Iloilo+-+Online+Maritime+Review+Center+for+Marine+Deck+%26+Engine+Officers!8m2!3d10.692854!4d122.5728575!16s%2Fg%2F11cm99x863!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee544ea40c90f:0x91322d4e8dfcf306!2m2!1d122.5728587!2d10.6928552?entry=ttu', '', 'Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00PM \r\nSaturday:  8:00 AM - 12:00PM \r\nSunday: Closed', '0998 512 8616', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/atlasiloilo/', 'review_center17.php', '[]', 'atlasiloilo26@gmail.com', '2025-10-07 14:37:00', '2026-02-28 07:17:57', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"jeep5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 9: MOHON TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep9.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"bus5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 9: MOHON TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus9.php\",\"description\":\"\"}]');
