(18, 'Score High English Proficiency Center', 'Score High English Proficiency Center is dedicated to helping students, professionals, and individuals improve their English language skills to achieve academic and career success. Whether you\'re preparing for proficiency exams like TOEFL, IELTS, or simply looking to enhance your speaking, listening, reading, and writing skills, we offer tailored courses designed for every level. Our experienced instructors focus on practical, effective strategies to boost your confidence and performance. At Score High, we believe that mastery of the English language opens doors to opportunities—and we are here to guide you every step of the way.', 'Third Floor, Rosary Bldg, 100 Iznart St., 5000, La Paz, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'uploads/Score High English Proficiency Center.png', 'uploads/img_68ed19ce14a2e4.99545422.png,uploads/img_68f7b11a354119.98160423.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31361.292600640736!2d122.5223418743164!3d10.722018200000006!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56e77122587%3A0xde7da8df63fafe07!2sScore%20High%20English%20Proficiency%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759756273061!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/BorjWuamAyzTRc7B7', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Score+High+English+Proficiency+Center/@10.7220182,122.5223419,14z/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x33aee56e77122587:0xde7da8df63fafe07!8m2!3d10.7010708!4d122.5691999!15sChVyZXZpZXcgY2VudGVycyBpbG9pbG8iAjgBkgEXZW5nbGlzaF9sYW5ndWFnZV9zY2hvb2yqAVIQASoSIg5yZXZpZXcgY2VudGVycyggMh8QASIbaZSxQ63oICsl7k6GuPg6NJajkb0eAfuM5Kd4MhkQAiIVcmV2aWV3IGNlbnRlcnMgaWxvaWxv4AEA!16s%2Fg%2F11d_t74f5x?entry=tts&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAwMS4wIPu8ASoASAFQAw%3D%3D&skid=e0d57726-743b-45bf-875f-1625f4d49c66', '', 'Monday - Friday: 9:00 AM-6:00 PM\r\nSaturday & Sunday: Closed', '(033) 338 4839', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/scoreHigh/', 'review_center18.php', '[]', '', '2025-10-07 14:37:55', '2026-02-28 07:20:20', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 