(2, 'HomeWork Study Hub', 'HomeWork Study Hub in Jaro, Iloilo City, is a cozy, student‑friendly coworking and study space offering reliable Wi‑Fi, printing services, conference/function rooms, relaxing amenities like a lounge/games area, and affordable refreshments for people who want a productive yet comfortable place to study or work.', 'PHH3+P9P, Jaro, Iloilo City, Iloilo', '', 'homeworkstudyhub@gmail.com', 'uploads/HomeWork Study Hub.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed158fdbbee4.48885567.jpg,uploads/img_68f75e256a8499.89444098.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.0665926370075!2d122.5508881750411!3d10.729347289416557!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5e96a24ce03%3A0xbc8b4c8725fcbc70!2sHomeWork%20Study%20Hub!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759754885655!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/2ZNv21EEpHXFb3W46', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//PHH3%2BP9P+HomeWork+Study+Hub,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7295409,122.5518708,17.5z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee5e96a24ce03:0xbc8b4c8725fcbc70!2sHomeWork+Study+Hub!8m2!3d10.7293473!4d122.5534631!16s%2Fg%2F11f66gd163!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee5e96a24ce03:0xbc8b4c8725fcbc70!2m2!1d122.5534631!2d10.7293473?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', 'Open Monday - Saturday: 10:00 AM-9:00 PM\r\nSunday: Closed', '(033) 501 0381', '[]', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/HomeWorkIloilo/', 'study_hub2.php', '', '', '[]', '[]', '2025-10-07 15:09:45', '2026-02-27 14:23:02', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 4: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA DIVERSION FESTIVE WALK LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep4.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 12: MANDURRIAO TO CITY PROPER VIA FESTIVE WALK \\/ B. AQUINO AVE.\",\"link\":\"jeep12.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 14: HIBAO-AN TO JARO VIA B. AQUINO AVE. \\/ FESTIVE\",\"link\":\"jeep14.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 21: TAGBAK \\/ BUNTATALA TO FESTIVE WALK VIA SM CITY 