(6, 'Mind’s Crib – Study Hub & Co-Working Space', 'Mind’s Crib – Study Hub & Co‑Working Space, located in Brgy. Lopez Jaena, Jaro, Iloilo City, offers students and professionals a quiet, accessible workspace with reliable facilities and friendly amenities for studying, remote work, group discussions, or focused tasks.', '2nd Floor, Lifeline Bldg. (Front of Acclaim and beside Minute Burger, Brgy Lopez Jaena St, Jaro, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', '', 'mindscribiloilo@gmail.com', 'uploads/Mind’s Crib – Study Hub & Co-Working Space.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ed15ce583e91.89287062.jpg,uploads/img_68f75e6277fa66.56320086.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.033625144824!2d122.5480368750412!3d10.731889989414208!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee5873f9da077%3A0xc9a481429c4876e7!2sMind&amp;amp;#39;s%20Crib%20-%20Study%20Hub%20and%20Co-Working%20Space!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759755092568!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/MyKnzzHhTeNDFuAz7', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//2nd+Floor,+Mind\'s+Crib+-+Study+Hub+and+Co-Working+Space,+Lifeline+Bldg.+(Front+of+Acclaim+and+beside+Minute+Burger,+Brgy+Lopez+Jaena+St,+Jaro,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.6932817,122.4974248,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee5873f9da077:0xc9a481429c4876e7!2sMind\'s+Crib+-+Study+Hub+and+Co-Working+Space!8m2!3d10.73189!4d122.5506118!16s%2Fg%2F11j94fk5rc!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee5873f9da077:0xc9a481429c4876e7!2m2!1d122.5506118!2d10.73189?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAxNC4', 'Open Monday - Saturday: 9:00 AM - 12:00 AM\r\nSunday: Closed', '(033) 336 0244', '[]', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/mindscrib/', 'study_hub6.php', '', '', '[]', '[]', '2025-10-07 15:11:56', '2026-02-27 14:28:08', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 22: UNGKA TO LA PAZ VIA CPU \\u2013 ISATU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep22.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"nam