(8, 'Allstar Travel and Events Co.', 'uploads/travel_agencies/card_69c4ceafc332a.png', 'uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c4ceafc33e4.png,uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c4cec54cc8c.png,uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c4ced2e0560.png', 'AllStar Travel & Events Co. is a trusted travel agency based in Iloilo City, Philippines, proudly serving travelers since 2008 with expertly crafted itineraries and personalized service. As a DOT-Accredited agency and Member of AIDATTO, we combine credibility with creativity, offering a full suite of services including air ticketing, hotel bookings, tour packages across the Philippines, Asia, Europe, Australia, Africa, the Americas, and even Antarctica, as well as education trips/field trips, company tours, cruises, tourist visas, and custom tours tailored to your goals. With over a decade of experience, we understand what todayâ€™s travelers needâ€”whether itâ€™s value, convenience, or once-in-a-lifetime experiencesâ€”and we use that insight to design smart, well-planned journeys that turn vacations into meaningful stories. From Iloilo to the world, AllStar Travel & Events Co. is your long-term partner in exploring more, experiencing more, and making every trip truly unforgettable.', 'OÃ±ate Street, Mandurriao, Iloilo City', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.2231096628184!2d122.53488607504106!3d10.717267389427946!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aefacb67b981fb%3A0x8bf6aa67abda67!2sAllStar%20Travel%20%26%20Events%20Co.!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sph!4v1774505580419!5m2!1sen!2sph', 'https://allstartravelandevents.com/', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/XHes9VBDdUv45kHw7', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//AllStar+Travel+%26+Events+Co.,+Onate+De+Leon+St,+Mandurriao,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.7172674,122.5348861,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aefacb67b981fb:0x8bf6aa67abda67!2sAllStar+Travel+%26+Events+Co.!8m2!3d10.7172674!4d122.537461!16s%2Fg%2F1pzt6zk9j!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aefacb67b981fb:0x8bf6aa67abda67!2