(9, 'Buenas Grande Travel and Tours', 'uploads/travel_agencies/card_69c4d04aa88cc.png', 'uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c4d04aa8a4b.png', 'VISION:\r\n\r\nâ€‹\r\n\r\nTo become the must-experience premier business and leisure travel and tours provider in the Philippines.\r\n\r\nâ€‹\r\n\r\nMISSION:\r\n\r\nâ€‹\r\n\r\nTo accomodare and provide the best custmer service and satisfaction for individuals, families and group through:\r\n\r\nâ€‹ â€‹\r\n\r\nSafe and secure travels.\r\n\r\nFun and beautiful places to explore, and\r\n\r\nInnovative and affordable packages that suits your budget.\r\n\r\nâ€‹\r\n\r\nCORE VALUES:\r\n\r\nâ€‹\r\n\r\n Sincerity\r\n\r\nWe will broaden the capacity of the company, to deliver the best to our customers, by partnering with the Airlines, Charter Flight Operators, Cruises, Hotel, Resorts and other tourism suppliers.\r\n\r\n            The sincerity to deliver what we have promised to\\our valued customers will show that the company is worthy of the trust given by the customers as their chosen travel and tours agency.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nExcellence\r\n\r\nWe will seek excellence in the field of travels and tours by providing quality service and innovative options that will suit the unique needs of the customers.\r\n\r\nThe passion to excel in every aspect of travel and ours to give high customer satisfaction will ensure customer loyalty in the long run.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCompetence\r\n\r\nWe will ensure to have the most efficient and effective staff in delivering the needs of the customers by regulating the highest standards of practice and establishing discipline and strict compliance to business ethics.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTeamwork\r\n\r\nThe teamwork within each members of the company will ensure that the company will continue to serve our customers our best efforts.\r\n\r\nEnvironment\r\n\r\nWe will ensure that the company operates responsibly to lessen the negative impacts in the environment to maintain the long sustainability of the company and advance positive impacts in the resources on which we depend.', '#50 Burgos St., La Paz, Iloilo City', '', 'https://travelandtoursbuen.wixsite.com/buenasgrandetnt', '', '', '[]', '(033) 330-3972 / 0922-883-1603', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'https://www.facebook.com/buenas16/', '', 'travel_agency9.php', '', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'travelandtoursbuenasgrande@yahoo.com', '[]'),
(10, 'Constellation Travels, Inc.', 'uploads/travel_agencies/card_69c4d0ec5349a.jpg', 'uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c4d0ec53592.jpg,uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c4d102dc07f.jpg', 'Constellation Travels has been a trusted leader in the Philippine travel industry since 1978.\r\n\r\nAs one of the largest locally owned travel agencies in the country, we manage over 230,000 transactions annually and continue to be the preferred travel services partner of major corporations and leading global shipping companies.\r\n\r\nWith more than four decades of expertise, we deliver a full range of travel management solutions, including marine and corporate travel services, airline ticketing, hotel reservations, tour packages, incentive programs, MICE arrangements, land transportation bookings, visa assistance, travel insurance, and dedicated after-office-hours support.\r\n\r\nWith a legacy built on reliability, professionalism, and genuine Filipino hospitality, Constellation Travels continues to provide world-class travel solutions to clients across the globe.', 'G/F D2 #22 Manfredâ€™s Bldg., Gen. Luna St., Iloilo City', '', 'https://constellationtravels.com.ph/', '', '', '[]', '(033) 503-3177 / 0917-866-6425', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', '1978', 'travel_agency10.php', '', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'vivien@constelltravel.com.ph', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 5: FESTIVE WALK TO CITY PROPER VIA B. AQUINO AVE. AND SM CITY\",\"link\":\"jeep5.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 9: MOHON TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep9.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep10.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 11: TICUD, LA PAZ TO CITY PROPER\",\"link\":\"jeep11.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepne