(25, 'Partners Travel & Tours', 'uploads/travel_agencies/card_69c523311ce12.png', 'uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c523311cf3a.png,uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c5233f7d08a.png', 'Partners Travel and Tours Limited is an international travel consultancy with strong representation in Washington, DC, Ghana, Zambia, and CÃ´te dâ€™Ivoire. With partnerships spanning the immigration, hospitality, and airline sectors, we provide seamless and affordable global travel solutions.\r\n\r\nFounded by travelers who have explored over 50 countries worldwide. We understand the needs of global citizens. Our extensive network and proven expertise make us the preferred partner for custom travel services and global mobility.\r\n\r\nAt Partners Travel and Tours, we go beyond bookings. We provide strategic, results-driven solutions for every traveler. Whether youâ€™re planning a holiday, migrating, or scheduling a business trip, our team delivers guidance you can trust â€” tailored to your destination and purpose.\r\n\r\nOur consultants draw on real-world knowledge, area expertise, and global insights to recommend the best path forward. We donâ€™t just serve clients â€” we partner with them every step of the way.', 'PH29+R58, Bonifacio Dr, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, Iloilo', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.4201742075447!2d122.56539227480384!3d10.702038889442234!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee56c31fefa0d%3A0xd11ff101eefc1749!2sPARTNERS%20TRAVEL%20%26%20TOURS!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sph!4v1774527210878!5m2!1sen!2sph', 'https://partnerstravels.com/', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/yoD2X6h6PWszyDUY6', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//PH29%2BR58+PARTNERS+TRAVEL+%26+TOURS,+Bonifacio+Dr,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+Iloilo/@10.7020389,122.5653923,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee56c31fefa0d:0xd11ff101eefc1749!2sPARTNERS+TRAVEL+%26+TOURS!8m2!3d10.7020389!4d122.5679672!16s%2Fg%2F11sb_0dgp9!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee56c31fefa0d:0xd11ff101eefc1749!2