(26, 'Rakso Air Travel & Tours, Inc.', 'uploads/travel_agencies/card_69c5247fb0267.jpg', 'uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c5247fb034c.jpg,uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c524a865c18.jpg,uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c524b48a254.png', 'PHILIPPINES TOP ONLINE & OFFLINE TRAVEL AGENCY FOR INTERNATIONAL TOURS, DOMESTIC TOURS AND AIR TICKETS.\r\nRakso Air Travel & Tours, Inc. is a Premium Travel Service Provider established in 1999. A pioneer in promoting the Philippines to the elite Korea market, Rakso Travel has since become a full-pledged travel agency specializing in the development of both inbound and outbound tour products for corporate incentives and leisure tours.\r\n\r\nAt its inception, Rakso Travel developed major PH destinations for the inbound Korea market. In 2001 it became an accredited member of the International Air Transport Association (IATA). As an IATA Agent, Rakso Travel has evolved into highly-disciplined and highly systematic ticket agent for more than 30 major international airlines.', 'Unit 1, Henry Chusuey International Hotel, Jalandoni St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.4558370971154!2d122.55929527504078!3d10.699280689444791!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee50a05ae8fa7%3A0x5888dd38ac716864!2sRakso%20Air%20Travel%20%26%20Tours%2C%20Inc.%20Iloilo%20Branch!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sph!4v1774527543697!5m2!1sen!2sph', 'https://www.raksotravel.com/', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rd2NBrsiB3d8htDi7', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Unit+1,+Rakso+Air+Travel+%26+Tours,+Inc.+Iloilo+Branch,+Henry+Chusuey+International+Hotel,+Jalandoni+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.6992807,122.5592953,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee50a05ae8fa7:0x5888dd38ac716864!2sRakso+Air+Travel+%26+Tours,+Inc.+Iloilo+Branch!8m2!3d10.6992807!4d122.5618702!16s%2Fg%2F11h8c37_8b!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x33aee50a05ae8fa7:0x5888dd38ac716864!2m2!1d122.5618755!2d10.6992813?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDM