(32, 'Trimeridian Travels', 'uploads/travel_agencies/card_69c5295ed2eaa.jpg', 'uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c5295ed2f5d.jpg,uploads/travel_agencies/detail_69c5296f520b7.png', 'TriMeridian Travels: with the main office nestled along Valeria Street, TriMeridian Travels offers a range of services that will definitely help everyone achieve their â€˜travel goalsâ€™. The company offers domestic and international ticketing, travel tours, hotel booking, cruise booking, and visa processing.\r\n\r\nTriMeridian Travels is a young dynamic company based in Iloilo City, Philippines. That is accredited by the Department of Tourism of the Philippines and accredited travel agents for Philippine Airlines and most International flag carriers. We are a one stop Travel Agency that provides a complete range of travel related services. We excel in designing tailor made travel solutions that cater to each and every clientâ€™s needs,â€ states Louie Vincent Chan Chua of TriMeridian Travels.\r\n\r\nOur service is not just limited to airline ticket sales, we also provide hotel reservations and bookings, local transfers, car rentals and visa assistance, inbound and outbound tour packages, cruise holidays, travel insurance cover, travel guides and timetables,â€ adds Chua.', 'G/F Iloilo 3B Auto Parts Bldg., Valeria Extension., Brgy. Magsaysay, Iloilo City', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3920.512667921712!2d122.56535697504076!3d10.694883889449002!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee565a437e049%3A0xd344593dfb1a1c7d!2sTriMeridian%20Travels!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sph!4v1774528760045!5m2!1sen!2sph', 'https://andreaguanco.com/trimeridian-travels/', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/LsaFL7zwTv5r1bnB6', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//TriMeridian+Travels,+Magsaysay+Road,+Valeria+St,+Iloilo+City+Proper,+Iloilo+City,+5000+Iloilo/@10.6948839,122.565357,17z/data=!4m16!1m7!3m6!1s0x33aee565a437e049:0xd344593dfb1a1c7d!2sTriMeridian+Travels!8m2!3d10.6948839!4d122.5679319!16s%2