(2, 'I-HOMES - Iloilo Home of Massage and Essential Spa Company', 'I‑HOMES (formerly Rosa Regina Massage and Spa Co.) is a highly rated massage spa in Iloilo City. It offers a relaxing and professional wellness experience, combining massage services and essential spa treatments in a clean, comfortable, and inviting environment.', '50 Jalandoni St, Iloilo City Proper, Iloilo City, 5000 Iloilo', '', 'uploads/img_68ecded7836689.07752051.jpg', 'uploads/img_68ecded783a647.85766761.jpg,uploads/img_68f643d83833c1.55371255.png', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d125462.35792210548!2d122.29532506426938!3d10.680479889817684!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x33aee52ffc7ea5a5%3A0xc9048fa99e77c9e0!2sOne%20Madison%20Place%20Luxury%20Residences!5e0!3m2!1sfil!2sph!4v1759904324949!5m2!1sfil!2sph', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/FSM2Tkz4NLRK4azq6', '', 'Monday, 12 PM–12 AM\r\nTuesday, 12 PM–12 AM\r\nWednesday, 12 PM–12 AM\r\nThursday, 12 PM–12 AM\r\nFriday, 12 PM–12 AM\r\nSaturday, 12 PM–12 AM\r\nSunday, 12 PM–12 AM', '0945 514 7491', '', '', '', '', '', 'Ihomes.essentials@gmail.com', '', '', 'https://www.facebook.com/p/I-Homes-Iloilo-Home-of-Massage-and-Essential-Spa-Company-100093373524961/', '', 0.0, 'wellness_spa2.php', '2025-10-08 08:03:29', '2026-02-26 12:23:36', '[{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER VIA CPU LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep3.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 10: BUNTATALA \\/ TAGBAK TERMINAL TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"jeep10.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"jeepney\",\"name\":\"Route 11: TICUD, LA PAZ TO CITY PROPER\",\"link\":\"jeep11.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 1: BO. OBRERO, LAPUZ TO CITY PROPER LOOP\",\"link\":\"bus1.php\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"bus\",\"name\":\"ROUTE 3: UNGKA TO CITY PROPER V